    "name": "Surface API",
    "description": "Every auth shape, body mode and degradation the Postman emitter has to answer for.\n\n## Servers\n\nThis collection targets the first server. The API is also served at:\n\n- `https://sandbox.example.com` — Sandbox\n\n## Variables\n\nSet these collection variables before sending a request:\n\n- `apiKey` — The API key, sent as the `api_key` query.\n- `basicUsername` — The username to authenticate with.\n- `basicPassword` — The password to authenticate with.\n- `bearer` — The bearer token sent in the `Authorization` header.\n- `digestUsername` — The username to authenticate with.\n- `digestPassword` — The password to authenticate with.\n- `oauthClientId` — The OAuth client id.\n- `oauthClientSecret` — The OAuth client secret.\n- `sessionCookie` — The API key, sent as the `session` cookie.\n\n## About\n\n- Contact: API Team <api@example.com>\n- Licence: [MIT](https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT)\n- Terms of service: https://example.com/terms",
